# Firebase Android config (google-services.json) is tracked on purpose. EAS Build
# uploads only git-tracked files, so ignoring it fails the Android build with
# "google-services.json is missing". It holds no secret — the same values ship
# inside every APK — and its Android API key is restricted by package name and
# signing certificate, not by keeping the file private.